{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The city cries out for heroes. Can you answer the call?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>Eight Dragons 2</strong> is a high-octane <strong>beat 'em up</strong> that revives the golden era of <strong>arcade</strong> gaming with electrifying <strong>side-scrolling</strong> action. Team up with up to 7 friends in local or online <strong>co-op</strong> to unleash devastating <strong>combos</strong> and pummel waves of cunning <strong>enemies</strong> in a vibrant <strong>2D</strong> world. As a band of fearless fighters, you\u2019ll battle through four distinct districts to topple a ruthless criminal empire in this explosive <strong>brawler</strong> sequel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/gifclips3.gif?t=1748601796\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ultimate 8-Player Co-op</strong>: Join forces in local or online <strong>multiplayer</strong> for chaotic, cooperative <strong>gameplay</strong>, coordinating epic takedowns with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro Arcade Action</strong>: Dive into classic <strong>side-scrolling</strong> combat, blending nostalgic <strong>arcade</strong> vibes with modern mechanics and stunning <strong>pixel graphics</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Characters</strong>: Choose from 8 unique <strong>characters</strong>, each with distinct <strong>fighting</strong> styles, special moves, and leveling systems to master powerful <strong>combos</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/gifclips5.gif?t=1748601796\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thrilling Environments</strong>: Fight through four diverse districts, from neon-lit streets to gritty slums, crushing <strong>enemies</strong> and brutal bosses with fists or improvised weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/gifclips2.gif?t=1748601796\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relive the thrill of 80s and 90s\u00a0<strong>arcade brawlers</strong> and reclaim the city in <strong>Eight Dragons 2</strong>\u2014solo or with your crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/ED2_ARTWORK.png?t=1748601796\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Eight Dragons 2: Fight alone. Fight together. Just remember... someone will pay.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2132260?t=1748601796","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2132260?t=1748601796","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/dbdd4e712c17cc7e818de45193d07a7e29e6097a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748601796","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/dbdd4e712c17cc7e818de45193d07a7e29e6097a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748601796","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3462020,"description":""}],"detaile